add('Acquisition','Genome collection','Combined the two preserved genome-file collections.','3,130 NCBI-directory files + 635 additional files','3,765 input FASTA files are supported by the deduplication manifest.','A traceable public assembly collection, before sequence redundancy and QC.','The defensible starting count differs from the draft count of 4,454.','Verified','Acquisition dates, original download command and 1,324 secondary-source records are not independently recoverable. Additional collection is attributed to Pseudomonas Genome Database only in drafts.','acquisition','Count directory members and reconcile the complete input manifest; no new downloads.')
