add('Quality control','Completeness and contamination','Applied CheckM2 standard pass thresholds; tracked stringent subset separately.','1,619 QUAST-passing assemblies','1,604 standard pass; 6 review + 9 fail excluded; 1,592 stringent among the 1,619.','Retained assemblies meet ≥95% completeness and ≤5% contamination.','Only 1,585 of the final 1,595 meet ≥98% completeness / ≤2% contamination; 10 are standard-only.','Verified','Do not describe every final assembly as stringent. These are quality predictions.','checkm','CheckM2 1.1.0; uniref100.KO.1.dmnd; database release not recoverable.')
