add('Habitat comparison','Gene-frequency association, correct matching','Independently reproduced two-sided Fisher tests with BH correction over 43,001 clusters.','1,350 clinical + 99 environmental labelled assemblies','Four q<0.05: xerC/xerD cluster, sul1 cluster, group_5721 and group_29837; all |Δ frequency|>0.10.','Associations describe historical metadata groups, without phylogenetic adjustment.','Recombinase- and sul1-labelled clusters are more frequent in the clinical-labelled group; two hypothetical clusters show the opposite direction.','Preliminary','Source recuration, repeated BioSamples, lineage structure and 13.64:1 imbalance prevent habitat-adaptation conclusions.','comparison','Fisher exact, two-sided; BH all 43,001; report effects and adjusted P values; details on Clinical vs Env sheet.')
