add('Functional associations','Cross-functional correlations and networks','Reviewed burden correlations, CDS adjustment, pairwise Fisher tests and network construction.','1,350 genomes; feature-specific prevalence filters','AMP–ARG 11,454 tests / 1,649 BH-significant pairs; AMR–AMR 3,403 / 1,030. Combined stringent network 252 nodes / 398 edges.','Co-distribution can prioritize hypotheses but is not functional interaction.','qacEdelta1–sul1 cooccurs in 436 genomes (phi 0.9189; q≈9.93×10⁻²⁹²).','Exploratory','No phylogenetic adjustment; combined network depends on problematic BGC features. Multiple-testing significance does not establish independence from lineage.','functional_stats','Fisher two-sided; BH per comparison family; feature prevalence 14–1,336 of 1,350; network |phi|≥0.5 and q<0.05.')
